cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use pyionics in your research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "pyionics: Python access to NIST ILThermo ionic liquid data"
abstract: >-
  pyionics downloads ionic liquid property data from the NIST ILThermo
  database and converts it into clean CSV/TSV tables with SMILES for
  data analysis and QSPR modelling.
authors:
  - family-names: Heydarov
    given-names: Kamran
    affiliation: University of Strasbourg
version: 0.4.3
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/kammmran/pyionics"
url: "https://pypi.org/project/pyionics/"
keywords:
  - ionic liquids
  - ILThermo
  - NIST
  - cheminformatics
  - QSPR
  - dataset
